{'symbol': 'BMY', 'date': '2023-06-28 08:00:00', 'title': 'K36 THERAPEUTICS ANNOUNCES $70 MILLION SERIES B FINANCING TO FUND CLINICAL PROOF OF CONCEPT OF KTX-1001, FIRST-IN-CLASS INHIBITOR OF MMSET FOR TREATMENT OF MULTIPLE MYELOMA PATIENTS WITH GENETIC TRANSLOCATION (4;14)', 'text': 'FUNDS RAISED WILL BE USED TO DEMONSTRATE CLINICAL VALIDATION AND PROOF-OF-CONCEPT IN T(4;14) MULTIPLE MYELOMA WITH KTX-1001 MONOTHERAPY AND KTX-1001 COMBINATION REGIMENS WITH EXISTING STANDARD-OF-CARE AGENTS CAMBRIDGE, MASS., JUNE 28, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- K36 THERAPEUTICS\xa0("K36"), A PRIVATELY HELD CLINICAL-STAGE BIOTECH COMPANY DEVELOPING KTX-1001, AN INVESTIGATIONAL SMALL MOLECULE METHYLTRANSFERASE INHIBITOR OF MULTIPLE MYELOMA SET (MMSET) DOMAIN, TODAY ANNOUNCED A $70M SERIES B FINANCING.'}